Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["InfraUnion", "ObjectName",
 CellID->1224892054,ExpressionUUID->"8393d601-4014-44ba-afc9-60862df940ec"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"07622257-7079-4318-9ee7-8839a1552b90"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
      TextData["InfraUnion"]], 
     "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraUnion", 
     "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
    "PackageLink",
    BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"], "[", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["graph", "TI"], ",", " ", 
    StyleBox["obj1", "TI"], ",", " ", 
    StyleBox["obj2", "TI"], ",", " ", "..."}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "ded5473d-4d8a-499b-a87f-cc38db6fed99"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "returns the vertex-set union of the given shapes on graph \[LongDash] \
vertex lists, densities, walk graphs \[LongDash] as a sorted List.",
 "\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"3807b7f0-9e8f-4304-b082-6206d675554d"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
      TextData["InfraUnion"]], 
     "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraUnion", 
     "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
    "PackageLink",
    BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"], "[", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["obj1", "TI"], ",", " ", 
    StyleBox["obj2", "TI"]}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0112b880-5d24-4518-a425-dbcf513030c6"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "of two Euclidean heads is itself a symbolic object; InfraMeasurement \
evaluates it on a graph."
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"9b1aa319-4c8a-4b27-bf42-aac6df37fc18"],

Cell["\<\
On heads, InfraMeasurement gives the union its \"VertexDensity\" \[LongDash] \
the sum of the two densities \[LongDash] its \"Subgraph\" and the two \
measures. It is not a family of walks, so it has no \"Graph\", \
\"Cardinality\", \"Length\", \"EdgeDensity\" or \"Faithful\".\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"c68b86e2-39d8-435a-bd96-aab2a556e89b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Inside InfraScene hypotheses ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"InfraUnion", "[", 
   RowBox[{"c1", ",", " ", "c2"}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1d1e3287-a556-4efc-bffb-8ab54d18037a"],
 " is the union token: every vertex of either object is one branch. \
Evaluation is postponed until the bindings resolve and the scene engine \
supplies the graph."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"85da4a64-7981-4e81-975a-8051313b6bad"]
}, Open  ]],

